Interventions include but are not limited to weight management and maintenance/repletion of patient nutritional status;
- /C15 addressing inflammation, obtaining a euvolemic state, contributing to correction of electrolyte abnormalities, assisting in anemia management, and managing bone disease through nutrition assessment and dietary interventions including individualized meal plans;
- /C15 assisting in identifying medication errors and need for adjustment in collaboration with nephrology provider (medical doctor, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant);
- /C15 providing and updating nutrition therapy as new knowledge emerges.
